# cf.look night-glow: Night projections: glowing but unclipped highlights (max-RGB shoulder), deep but open blacks, richer reds/magentas/blues for 'Colours of Love', protected skin, slightly cool night shadows. Built for HLG night footage with a -0.5 stop node-1 CDL (reels/reel-01/look-compare in the berlin-2026-10-11 Walk).
